<title>NIGERIA: Guaranty Trust Bank listed on Nigerian bourse.</title>
<headline>Guaranty Trust Bank listed on Nigerian bourse.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nigeria's Guaranty Trust Bank were listed for sale on the stock exchange on Monday for the first time.</p>
<p>A total of 400 million ordinary shares were introduced at 10 naira each, giving a market capitalisation of four billion naira.</p>
<p>The shares which had not been publicly quoted were previously in the hands of 670 shareholders.</p>
<p>The commercial bank, started in 1990, has grown to become one of Nigeria's biggest banks.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 1943</p>
